hotonekill="Mermaid Rusy defenced One-hit Kill";TXT.khan68_defence_oneshotonekill="Iron Khan defenced One-hit Kill";TXT.khan85_defence_oneshotonekill="IronPaladin Khan defenced One-hit Kill";TXT.luck_event_whether1="Completed attending";TXT.luck_event_whether2="Unable attending";TXT.luck_event_not_time="It is not a period of lucky event.";TXT.luck_event_all_Participate="You already applied to all lucky event. ";TXT.luck_event_popup_text1="Do you want to apply to lucky event?";TXT.luck_event_text1="We will give 100%";TXT.input_change_name="Input your name!";TXT.caution_abnormal_name="Caution! If you use an inappropriate name, your account will be suspended without prior notice.";TXT.name_already_use="This is the name someone is already using. Please enter a different name.";TXT.gongji_cache="If events and updates do not apply, please delete the cache from your browser settings and re-enable it!";TXT.gongji_cache2="If events and updates do not apply, please delete the app and reinstall it!";TXT.clear_200stage_text1="Finally, El Dorado expedition face up the golden lighting shine under deep blue sea.";TXT.clear_200stage_text2="In front of it 'Ace' found a button";TXT.clear_200stage_text3="and pressed it like attracting something";TXT.clear_200stage_text4="As press a button, Bottom of sea was shaking finally sank Golden city was appeared.";TXT.clear_200stage_text5="As Water drain slowly, The golden city floats completely above the sea.";TXT.clear_200stage_text6="'Ace' and friends had the pleasure of finding golden city 'El Dorado'.";TXT.clear_200stage_text7="However, at that time an unknown sound";TXT.clear_200stage_text8="was heard and a girl's illusion appeared";TXT.clear_200stage_text9="The girl said, 'Congratulation to find the El Dorado'<br>But, It would sink again soon unfortunately.";TXT.clear_200stage_text10="Because disappearing Midas hand that should be in the heart of the golden city, <br>The El Dorado will sink into the deep sea again.";TXT.clear_200stage_text11="'Ace' asked why Midas hands disappeared ? and the girl answered.";TXT.clear_200stage_text12="Gullveig who obsessed about gold and became a god of greed, stole the Midas hand.<br>Midas hand is a mysterious thing that could change stuff to gold if it contacts with them.";TXT.clear_200stage_text13="The girl said, Gullveig stole it run away to the gate of worldview.";TXT.clear_200stage_text14="'Ace and friends get into the gate of worldview";TXT.clear_200stage_text15="but the gate was not working as no reason.";TXT.clear_200stage_text16="The gate of worldview requires 10 gems to open";TXT.clear_200stage_text17="Gullveig already stole gems and hide in the hard mode";TXT.clear_200stage_text18="And Monsters in the hard map get stronger by gems.";TXT.clear_200stage_text19="Could heroes find lost gems and open the gate of worldview?<br>Could heroes beat Gullveig and put the Midas hand back ?";TXT.clear_200stage_notice="Congratulations! Our base is upgraded to golden.";TXT.normal="Normal";TXT.hard="Hard";TXT.normal_mode="Normal Mode";TXT.hard_mode="Hard Mode";TXT.hard_mode_open="Hard mode is being prepared.";TXT.item="Item";TXT.item_menu1="All";TXT.item_menu2="Clock";TXT.item_menu3="Sword";TXT.item_menu4="Shield";TXT.item_menu5="Wings";TXT.item_none="No<br>items";TXT.item_submenu1="Equip";TXT.item_submenu1_cancel="Unequip";TXT.item_submenu1_movechar="Move ally<br>in use";TXT.item_submenu2="Sell";TXT.item_submenu3="Grade up";TXT.item_submenu4="";TXT.item_submenu5="Set Ability";TXT.item_submenu6="Close";TXT.item_set_ability_title="Exclusive Item Set Ability";TXT.item_no_set_ability="This item has no set ability.";TXT.item_base_option="basic ability";TXT.item_add_option="additional ability";TXT.item_name111="Clock";TXT.item_name112="Clock";TXT.item_name113="Clock";TXT.item_name121="Clock";TXT.item_name122="Clock";TXT.item_name123="Clock";TXT.item_name131="Clock";TXT.item_name132="Clock";TXT.item_name133="Clock";TXT.item_name141="Clock";TXT.item_name142="Clock";TXT.item_nam